OL,3,GNEWSAG20 summit will give city 'chance
OL,4,Ato shine', leaders say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHosting world leaders at the G20 summit
OL,7,Fin Manchester in 2027 will give the
OL,8,Fcity a "chance to shine", according to
OL,9,Fbusiness leaders.
OL,11,FThe annual gathering of the world's
OL,12,Flargest economies will take place on 27
OL,13,Fand 28 November 2027 at the Manchester
OL,14,FCentral Convention Centre.
OL,16,FThe last time the summit was held in
OL,17,Fthe UK was in 2009 when it was hosted
OL,18,Fin London. The cost of the security
OL,19,Foperation at the time was an estimated
OL,20,F#7.2m.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
