OL,3,GNEWSAG20 summit will give city 'chance
OL,4,Ato shine', leaders say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Chief Constable Chris Sykes
OL,7,Ffrom Greater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,8,Fsaid it would be a "complex and
OL,9,Fsignificant security operation".
